<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s203S">Because you have <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w1">talked meaninglessly</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w3">fruits</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w4">refuse</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w5">grow</span> on the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w2">trees</span>, or they start to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w7">grow</span> at the <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w6">wrong times</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w8">never</span> at the <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w23">right times</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w12">seem</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w11">ripe</span> when they&#x27;re still <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w9">not</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w10">ripe</span>, or their <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w13">roots</span> are <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s203w14">frail</span>, or they ca<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s203w16">n&#x27;t</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w17">stay</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w15">long</span>; there are no places to take your leisure, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w18">parks</span>, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w19">glades</span>, no <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w20">pools of cool water</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w22">many</span> things around to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w24">make</span> you <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s203w21">afraid</span>.</span>
