<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; AI NOTE: PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independently reconciled. tshig kyal ba licenses talked meaninglessly through its speech component; supplied participants and auxiliaries remain unpaired. The second of three 'bras bu occurrences owns fruits, while the first attributive and third resumed occurrence are omitted as redistributed content. The first two 'chags pa occurrences own grow in order; the third is elided after right times. dus min and dus su are temporal phrase links, the latter also HGM-attested as right times. mi occurrences one, two and four own refuse, never and n't respectively; occurrence three is within the full privative frail phrase and occurrence five is omitted. The two ripe links cross: smin pa owns the last ripe and smin par the first. Parks is supported by the target and the park of Anatapindada / kun dga' ra ba construction in C06; the provisional gardens glossary entry does not exclude this attestation. rdzing bu owns the HGM-attested pools of cool water. nyams dga' ba mi mang ba and the repeated no/leisure expansion remain omitted: uncertainty or not-many cannot be banked as absolute absence. rgyu licenses make as a causal noun recast to a causative verb, supported by HGM's make gloss; it does not license things, around or you. No uncertain mapping is nulled.</div>
